m the infinite-pure faithful normal semifinite **weight**.\n15-\n16-## Results, by status\n17-\n18:**(a) Checked infrastructure (no premise).**\n19-\n20-* Sections 1–2: the two commuting amplification `⋆`-homomorphisms\n21-  `lampHom : B(K₁) →⋆ₐ[ℂ] B(K₁ ⊗̂ K₂)` and `rampHom : B(K₂) →⋆ₐ[ℂ] B(K₁ ⊗̂ K₂)`, including the\n--\n25-* Section 3: `tensorOpC_eq_amp`, `pureFactorSet_eq`, `mixedFactorSet_eq`.\n26-* Section 4: the finite-pure functional `finitePureTrace` with `finitePureTrace_one`,\n27-  `finitePureTrace_positive`, `finitePureTrace_isFiniteVectorNormal`, the elementary-product\n28:  formula `finitePureTrace_lamp_ramp`, traciality on elementary products\n29:  `finitePureTrace_tracial_lamp_ramp`, and faithfulness from a separating family.\n30-* Sections 5, 7, 8: transport of functionals and of `ℝ≥0∞`-valued weights along a unitary, plus\n31-  the unconditional weight calculus (`vectorWeight_add`, `vectorWeight_smul`,\n32-  `vectorWeight_star_mul_self`, `vectorWeight_one_eq_top`).\n--\n40-* `regionalAlgebra_weight_one_eq_top`: in the infinite-pure case the transported weight takes\n41-  the value `∞` on `1`, so it is provably **not** a state.\n42-\n43:**(c) Conditional theorems, with their exact extra premises.**\n44-\n45-* `spatialTensorAlgebra_hasTrivialCenter`, `regionalAlgebra_hasTrivialCenter`\n46:  (premise `SpatialFactorPremises`: `pure_nontrivial`, `pure_commutant`, `mixed_factor`).\n47-* `spatialTensorAlgebra_isNormalizedTracialState`,\n48-  `regionalAlgebra_isNormalizedTracialState`\n49:  (premise `FinitePureTracePremises`: `mixed_unit`, `tracial`, `separating`).\n50-* `spatialTensorAlgebra_isFaithfulNormalSemifiniteWeight`,\n51-  `regionalAlgebra_isFaithfulNormalSemifiniteWeight`\n52:  (premise `InfinitePureWeightPremises`: `mixed_unit`, `separating`, `semifinite`, `tracial`).\n53-\n54:**(d) Auxiliary assumptions used (all explicit Lean structure fields, never axioms).**\n55-\n56:1. `SpatialFactorPremises.pure_commutant` — the commutation theorem for the 