mg : D.productGNSUnitary.conjStarAlgEquiv '' D.spatialTensorAlgebra\n  1526\t      = regionalAlgebra D := unitaryConj_image_spatial D\n  1527\t  rwa [himg] at hmain\n  1528\t\n  1529\t/-- **The infinite-pure weight is not a state.**  Its value on the identity operator is `∞`,\n  1530\tboth spatially and after transport to the regional algebra. -/\n  1531\ttheorem regionalAlgebra_weight_one_eq_top [Infinite ι]\n  1532\t    (e : HilbertBasis ι ℂ D.PureGNS) (Ω : D.MixedGNS)\n  1533\t    (hΩ : ‖Ω‖ = 1) :\n  1534\t    transportWeight D.productGNSUnitary (infinitePureWeight (⇑e) Ω) 1 = ⊤ := by\n  1535\t  show infinitePureWeight (⇑e) Ω (D.productGNSUnitary.conjStarAlgEquiv.symm 1) = ⊤\n  1536\t  rw [map_one]\n  1537\t  exact infinitePureWeight_one_eq_top e hΩ\n  1538\t\n  1539\tend InfinitePureRegional\n  1540\t\n  1541\t\n  1542\t/-! ## 10. The bundled spatial `⋆`-isomorphism\n  1543\t\n  1544\tSection 3 identified the regional algebra with the spatial tensor product as *sets* of operators.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
